{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEPZGyYCvcX8AXCa2YXu", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：늑백（勒帛）。**\n\n韩国传统冠礼的第一次加冠（시가）时，冠者穿上사규삼，系上늑백，再穿채극（彩屐，彩色木屐）。\n\n有一处说法不一致要说明：这次搜到的韩国学中央研究院百科在这里把늑백解释为“행전”（绑腿），而题目说的是固定사규삼的“带子”。只搜了 1 次，没有再找其他资料核实这个差别。不过题目问的就是这个物件，两边指的都是늑백这个名字。\n\n依据：\n- [한국민족문화대백과사전（韩国学中央研究院）：사규삼](https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0025405)\n- [한국민족문화대백과사전：관례](https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0004809)\n- [Wikipedia: Sagyusam](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sagyusam)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1480, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4307, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1480}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:53:32.292Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEPZGitqRQy1RgGuB4Zt"}
